{
  "name": "onboard-tracks",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## onboard-tracks\nReads the student's saved profile and quiz, asks the course model for 3 career tracks with reasons, saves them to `interest_results`, logs `ai_runs`, and replies to the website.\n\n**After import:**\n1. **AI settings** → replace `COURSE-MODEL-NAME` with the course model's name.\n2. **Auth check** → choose `cc-auth-and-limits` from the list.\n3. **Course model** should show `CC Model`.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "99457a5f-da8d-48c6-95f6-11797cf9d906",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Tokens and cost\nn8n's AI nodes don't pass token counts on to later nodes, so **Log success** leaves tokens and cost empty. During test runs, open **Course model** in the execution and read its token usage; record those as estimates (the brief allows this).",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "85749857-aa93-4da2-af20-d0fb9d085f28",
      "name": "Tokens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
